nd that you know  you can trust so you know he's not going  to put you in a position where you can't  get out of it he's gonna work with you  but he's not he's it's not going to be  anything you've ever imagined before  that it's very  which is the case with Gary obviously  but it's not very positive what I'm  going to say but but I think I think you  just have to learn to be really really  to not take it take it  all personally whether that be success  or failure or rejection or you know  audience going head over heels about you  you just got to keep it all in one place  in a very safe box because the rejection  doesn't get any better  you know after 30 years of doing this  job if somebody says no you can't have  that job ah it's awful me what's wrong  with me and you know it's it hasn't got  any better since I was 20 you know it's  the same and the success is thrilling  and but actually I am better at enjoying  the success but knowing that it's I can  keep it in the box but I can enjoy it in  the box yeah  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]
 

